        "name": "heartgold-soulsilver",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/10/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur charge son énergie, puis\nattaque. La puissance est doublée\nsi le lanceur agit après l’ennemi.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user stores power, then attacks.\nIf the user can use this attack after\nthe target, its power is doubled.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user stores power, then attacks.\nIf the user can use this attack after\nthe target, its power is doubled.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-2-white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/14/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ちからを　ためこみ　こうげきする。\nあいてより　あとに　だせると\nわざの　いりょくは　２ばいに　なる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "힘을 모아 공격한다.\n상대보다 나중에 쓰면\n기술의 위력은 2배가 된다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur charge son énergie, puis attaque.\nLa puissance est doublée si le lanceur agit\naprès l’ennemi.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Der Anwender lädt die Attacke auf. Handelt das\nZiel vor dem Anwender, verdoppelt sich die Kraft\nder Attacke.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Oprime al enemigo de cuatro a cinco turnos,\ndurante los cuales no podrá huir.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa accumula forza, poi attacca.\nLa potenza raddoppia se agisce dopo il Pokémon\nnemico.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user stores power, then attacks.\nIf the user moves after the target,\nthis attack’s power will be doubled.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ためこんで　攻撃する。\n相手より　後に　攻撃できると\n技の　威力は　２倍に　なる。",
