        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用蓄滿電流的牙齒咬住對手。\n有時會讓對手畏縮\n或陷入麻痺狀態。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur utilise une morsure électrifiée.\nPeut aussi paralyser ou apeurer l’ennemi.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Anwender beißt mit elektrifizierten Reißzähnen zu.\nZiel schreckt eventuell zurück oder wird paralysiert.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El usuario muerde al objetivo con colmillos\nelectrificados y puede hacer que se amedrente\no se paralice.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa morde con denti elettrificati che possono\nanche paralizzare o far tentennare il bersaglio.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user bites with electrified fangs. This may also\nmake the target flinch or leave it with paralysis.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "電気を　ためた　キバで　かみつく。\n相手を　ひるませたり\nまひ状態に　することが　ある。",
